{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44234","headline":"寄国香 · 鱼玄机","name":"寄国香","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旦夕醉吟身，相思又此春。\n雨中寄书使，窗下断肠人。\n山卷珠帘看，愁随芳草新。\n别来清宴上，几度落梁尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}